<title>USA: AXA shareholders approve name change.</title>
<headline>AXA shareholders approve name change.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axa SA said Thursday its shareholders had approved a resolution to change the name of the holding company from Axa SA to AXA-UAP.</p>
<p>The approval came at a meeting on January 22.</p>
<p>In November, Axa and Union des Assurances de Paris announced plans to merge.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
